stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : [Campaign Engine] Task created for eligible device in wave
    PENDING --> DOWNLOADING : [Server on Check-in] Wave RUNNING + in maintenanceWindow + slot acquired
    PENDING --> TIMEOUT : [Timeout Sweeper] Wave past deadlineAt (WAVE_DEADLINE_EXCEEDED, no retry)
    PENDING --> FAILED : [Server] Campaign ABORTED (CAMPAIGN_ABORTED) or INCOMPATIBLE (no retry)

    DOWNLOADING --> INSTALLING : [Device /result] stage = DOWNLOADED/INSTALLING, SHA-256 valid (release slot)
    DOWNLOADING --> FAILED : [Device /result] Network error / SHA-256 mismatch (release slot)
    DOWNLOADING --> TIMEOUT : [Timeout Sweeper] > 15m without heartbeat (release slot)

    INSTALLING --> VERIFYING : [Device /result] Flashed inactive Bank B + reboot initiated
    INSTALLING --> FAILED : [Device /result] Flash write error
    INSTALLING --> TIMEOUT : [Timeout Sweeper] > 10m without heartbeat

    VERIFYING --> SUCCESS : [Device /result or Check-in Reconcile] Boot + self-test OK\n(atomic update currentFirmwareId + history)
    VERIFYING --> ROLLED_BACK : [Bootloader Watchdog / Device] 3x boot-loop -> revert to Bank A\n(no auto-retry)
    VERIFYING --> TIMEOUT : [Timeout Sweeper] > 5m post-reboot silence

    FAILED --> PENDING : [Server] Retry remaining (attemptCount < 3, backoff 1m -> 5m -> 15m)
    TIMEOUT --> PENDING : [Server] Retry remaining (attemptCount < 3, backoff 1m -> 5m -> 15m)

    TIMEOUT --> SUCCESS : [Server Reconcile] Late check-in already running target firmware
    TIMEOUT --> ROLLED_BACK : [Device Late Report] Watchdog reverted to Bank A

    SUCCESS --> [*]
    ROLLED_BACK --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*] : Retry budget exhausted (attemptCount = 3) or CAMPAIGN_ABORTED
    TIMEOUT --> [*] : Retry budget exhausted (attemptCount = 3) or WAVE_DEADLINE_EXCEEDED
